  "description": "A .NET library for working with Revit Server REST API. Provides easy access to Revit Server operations including folder management, project operations, locking, and history tracking. REST and Admin UI clients for Revit Server 2012 and later; direct export of models to RVT files over the Revit Server ModelService (net.tcp) with a bundled set of Autodesk client assemblies.",
  "frameworkAssemblyGroup": {
